<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboard.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/seed-packets.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/watch-yourself.css">
</head>
<body class="app-body">
  <div class="app-layout">
    <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>
    <main class="main-content">

      <header class="dash-header">
        <div class="dash-greeting">
          <h1 class="dash-greeting-text">Resources</h1>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="dash-section">
        <div class="resources-grid">

          <a href="/seed-packets" class="resource-card">
            <div class="resource-card-inner">
              <img class="resource-card-art" src="/images/seed-packets.svg"
                   alt="" width="87" height="136">
              <h2 class="resource-card-title">Seed Packets</h2>
              <p class="resource-card-desc">These Seed Packets are like a map for your curiosity. Before we plant our goals and intentions for this course, let's figure out what makes you tick. This resource serves as a mirror, helping you see yourself more clearly. From this resource, we'll start to identify topics and side quests that would be cup-filling to explore in your creation practice.</p>
              <span class="resource-card-link">Open Seed Packets →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/block-buster" class="resource-card">
            <div class="resource-card-inner">
              <img class="resource-card-art" src="/images/block-buster.svg"
                   alt="A tumbling tower of wooden building blocks" width="107" height="136">
              <h2 class="resource-card-title">The Creative Block Buster</h2>
              <p class="resource-card-desc">Stuck? Every block has a few ways through it — like "film some POV footage" or "record a voice note for later" when the camera feels like too much. Add your own ways through as you find what works, and this becomes your personal playbook for the days it's hard to show up.</p>
              <span class="resource-card-link">Bust a block →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <!-- Watch Yourself — unlocks in Spring. Pre-Spring students see a
               locked preview linking to /upgrade so they know it's coming. -->
          <a href="<%= locals.showTending ? '/watch-yourself' : '/upgrade' %>"
             class="resource-card <%= locals.showTending ? '' : 'resource-card--locked' %>">
            <div class="resource-card-inner">
              <img class="resource-card-art resource-card-art--landscape"
                   src="/images/greenhouse/wateringcan-reflection.webp"
                   alt="" width="200" height="136">
              <h2 class="resource-card-title">Watch Yourself: A Guide</h2>
              <p class="resource-card-desc">Turning your inner critic into a helpful gardener. Watching yourself back is a skill — this resource walks you through how to do it without spiraling, how to tell a boring cutting from a not-yet-ready one, and how to reshape one recording into many kinds of content.</p>
              <span class="resource-card-link">
                <%= locals.showTending ? 'Open Watch Yourself →' : 'Unlocks in Spring →' %>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
